      "jp": "こんにちは、フェルミさん。\n見ての通り、トレーニングをしてるんですよ。",
      "jp_sha256": "5df2ee63cfb5d97b2e60169fdb228562494b4f6ac828bfe8e030d9854a605632",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "안녕하세요, 페르미 씨.\n보시다시피 훈련하고 있어요.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 13,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
