    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "1e6e931eda7ddb8c308b0e747f3823351fb92638d44f0f31b27484dabfc3a207",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "今度の運動会、教師対生徒の対抗リレーに\n僕も出場することになりまして、だから少しでも\n走力アップをと思って、こうして走り込みをしてるんです。",
      "jp_sha256": "34d8c573e08fb86664e62dae5be6d1620747f6eae22ef4e8b1dd861ede45e52c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "이번 운동회에서 교사 대 학생 대항 릴레이에\n저도 출전하게 돼서요. 조금이라도\n달리기 실력을 높이려고 이렇게 달리고 있어요.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 15,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b005-20261106-resume-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "4800b3394c96bd21bfab9ed406030fb9551b84b33a8dcac586c68b20be93fe11:000002_1076480586249416370:g0:r14",
      "row_index_0based": 14,
      "serialized_row_index": 14,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "今度の運動会、教師対生徒の対抗リレーに\n僕も出場することになりまして、だから少しでも\n走力アップをと思って、こうして走り込みをしてるんです。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "21c2f76089ac396338c20649644f695dbd143a6d8aba691908658b7e050c2b4b",
